  "description": "6th Floor Apartment overlooking the grounds of Elm Park Golf Course \n***UNDERFLOOR HEATING***\n A rare opportunity to rent a luxury one-bedroom apartment in Dublin 4 is the most exclusive development. Convenient to all the amenities of Ballsbridge, Donnybrook and Merrion, Elmpark is a short walk from St. Vincent's Hospital, University College Dublin and Booterstown Dart Station. The apartment is exceptionally private as it is not overlooked and has spectacular views over Elm Park Golf Course and Dublin Bay. \nElmpark offers a truly exceptional standard of living with spacious layout, high specifications throughout and architectural landscaped public areas. Accommodation in this 6th floor comprises entry hallway, living area, kitchen, master bedroom and main bathroom, audio entry-phone system, custom-designed kitchen with polished stone worktops, feature Italian sanitary ware and under-floor heating throughout, quality tiled and semi-solid timber floors throughout, as well as finishing touches such as brushed chrome sockets to living room and kitchen, solid Oak entrance door and TV and telephone points to all living areas and bedroom. \nThe apartment features a large winter garden/balcony with glazed balustrading and timber decking. \nThe development has 24 Hour Concierge/Security, monitored CCTV security system, high speed lifts to all floors and contemporary design to all areas. This apartment also offers one car parking space in the developments managed underground car park.",
